/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.

Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.
-/
theorem repr_map_id {F A A' E ι : Type*} [Field F] [CommRing A] [Algebra F A] [CommRing A'] [Algebra F A']
    [CommRing E] [Algebra F E] [Fintype ι] [DecidableEq ι] (b : Basis ι F E) (f : A →ₐ[F] A')
    (z : A ⊗[F] E) (k : ι) :
    (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A' b).repr (Algebra.TensorProduct.map f (AlgHom.id F E) z) k
      = f ((Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A b).repr z k) := by
  have hz : z = ∑ i, (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A b).repr z i • (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A b) i :=
    ((Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A b).sum_repr z).symm
  have hm : Algebra.TensorProduct.map f (AlgHom.id F E) z
      = ∑ i, f ((Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A b).repr z i) • (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A' b) i := by
    conv_lhs => rw [hz]
    rw [map_sum]
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ => ?_
    simp only [Algebra.TensorProduct.basis_apply, TensorProduct.smul_tmul', smul_eq_mul, mul_one,
      Algebra.TensorProduct.map_tmul, AlgHom.id_apply]
  rw [hm, (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis A' b).repr_sum_self]

/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Simplify to obtain the desired conclusion from the available facts.

Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
